            <div id="activation-feedback" class="hidden mt-8 bg-rose-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-rose-200 fade-in">
                <comment-tag id="5"><h3 class="font-bold text-rose-800 text-xl mb-4">Great work! Compare your drafts with these examples:</h3></comment-tag id="5" text="<h3 class=\"font-bold text-rose-800 text-xl mb-4\">Great work! Compare your answers with these examples:</h3>

Swapping 'models' for 'examples' provides slightly more universally recognized vocabulary for ESL students reviewing open-ended text answers." type="suggestion">
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-slate-700 font-medium">
