        <section id="section-signup" class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-slate-200 p-8 text-center mt-6 hidden-section fade-in border-t-8 border-t-blue-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            <div class="mb-6">
                <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4 title-font">Final Evaluation Quiz</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg">You have completed all study phases! Please enter your complete name to take the 20-item Level 4 quiz and earn your certificate.</p>
